{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>中午12時許，一名女子報案，指她在旺角花園街83號一單位企圖自殺，警方及救援人員到場，女事主情緒激動，並一度持刀，她其後被勸服送院檢驗。據悉，女事主因租務問題與業主發生爭執。</p>\n<h2>防止自殺求助熱線</h2>\n<p>「情緒通」精神健康支援熱線及WhatsApp：18111</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T06:54:09.580919+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T06:03:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T02:37:32.607639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T06:47:31.296588+00:00","content_hash":"bb27ede8a9eacff019d0294192f94a9363a495dde22b0fabded074b4e556ef16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}